{"sample\_id": "SGx", "component": "Si O2", "value": x, "unit": "% mol"}
{"sample\_id": "SGx", "component": "Ge O2", "value": (100 - x), "unit": "% mol"}

These lines should be generated for each of the synthesized glasses (SGx) with x representing the amount of Si O2 in mol%.

Example output:
{"sample\_id": "SG30", "component": "Si O2", "value": 30, "unit": "% mol"}
{"sample\_id": "SG30", "component": "Ge O2", "value": 70, "unit": "% mol"}
{"sample\_id": "SG50", "component": "Si O2", "value": 5
